{"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SQ","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SH","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AStarSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edge","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Weight","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edge","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The source is discovered first, at distance zero, with its estimate: the heuristic’s guess at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its distance to the target (zero for the target itself). Then, while a vertex is open, the one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the smallest distance plus estimate is examined (closed). When that is the target the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"search ends there. Otherwise each of its out-edges is examined in turn with the distance it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offers its target, the examined vertex’s distance plus the edge’s weight, and is then relaxed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the offer is smaller than the target’s distance or the target was not yet discovered, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not relaxed. A relaxed edge to an undiscovered vertex is followed by that vertex’s discovery;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one to a closed vertex, which only an inconsistent heuristic allows, by its reopening (the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Boost Graph Library’s black target), after which it is examined again. After its last out-edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the examined vertex is finished. When the target is never reached the search ends once no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex is open."}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/discover(_:distance:estimate:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/edgeNotRelaxed(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/edgeRelaxed(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/examine(_:distance:estimate:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/examineEdge(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/finish(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/reopen(_:distance:estimate:)"],"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","title":"Enumeration Cases"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/astarsearchevent"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What an A* search reports, in order, with the events of the Boost Graph Library’s A* visitor."}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"enum","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Enumeration","externalID":"s:13ShortestPaths16AStarSearchEventO","remoteSource":{"fileName":"AStarSearch.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearch.swift#L18"},"title":"AStarSearchEvent","modules":[{"name":"ShortestPaths"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AStarSearchEvent"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AStarSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://ShortestPaths/documentation/ShortestPaths/AStarSearchEvent/reopen(_:distance:estimate:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A closed vertex’s distance improved to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"distance"},{"type":"text","text":": it is open again."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reopen","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"distance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Weight","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"estimate","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Weight","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/astarsearchevent\/reopen(_:distance:estimate:)","role":"symbol